    # "She shuddered, letting out a whimpering moan as she seemed to be choking up with pleasure."
    "Elle frissonna, laissant échapper un gémissement plaintif comme si elle étouffait de plaisir."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:112
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_eda55646:

    # "Finally, fully spent inside of her, the tension slowly eased up as the two of us began to relax, trying to catch our breaths."
    "Finalement, complètement vidé en elle, la tension s'estompa lentement alors que nous commencions tous les deux à nous détendre, essayant de reprendre notre souffle."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:113
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_debd39d6:

    # MIKA "That was... {i}Unbelieveable...{/i}"
    MIKA "C'était... {i}Incroyable...{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:115
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_bfd76ffa:

    # "From down the narrow stretch of hallway, I could hear footsteps slowly approaching, and Mika, having heard it too, frantically pulled herself away from me."
    "Du bout du couloir étroit, j'entendais des pas s'approcher lentement, et Mika, l'ayant entendu elle aussi, s'éloigna frénétiquement de moi."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:116
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_60178c04:

    # "Grabbing my hand, she quickly pulled me behind one of the doors."
    "Attrapant ma main, elle me tira rapidement derrière l'une des portes."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:117
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_fe730d4c:

    # "Out of the line of sight, peering around the corner, I watched Sister Divine enter the hallway before making a swift turn."
    "Hors de vue, jetant un coup d'œil au coin, je vis Sœur Divine entrer dans le couloir avant de tourner brusquement."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:118
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_d382aabc:

    # "Whether she heard us or not, I wasn't sure, but the thought of nearly being caught sent my heart racing... As did it, Mika's."
    "Qu'elle nous ait entendus ou non, je n'en étais pas certain, mais la pensée d'avoir failli être pris fit battre mon cœur à tout rompre... Et celui de Mika aussi."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:119
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_85a90080:

    # MIKA @ scared "Is she gone?"
    MIKA @ scared "Est-elle partie ?"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:120
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_07266d13:

    # MC "Yes."
    MC "Oui."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:121
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_87530ef2:

    # "With a sigh of relief, Mika stepped back out."
    "Avec un soupir de soulagement, Mika ressortit."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:125
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_781117ec:

    # MIKA @ smile "By Palam's grace... I have no idea what I would do if I was actually caught! Haha!"
    MIKA @ smile "Par la grâce de Palam... Je n'ai aucune idée de ce que je ferais si j'étais vraiment attrapé ! Haha !"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:126
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_5fe3c606:

    # MC @ smile "Was it everything you were hoping for?"
    MC @ smile "Était-ce tout ce que tu espérais ?"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:127
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_e9fac387:

    # "Mika bit down on her lower lip gently."
    "Mika se mordit doucement la lèvre inférieure."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:128
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_22fd4753:

    # MIKA @ lewd "Mmm... I'm not sure."
    MIKA @ lewd "Mmm... Je ne suis pas sûre."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:129
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_105dd0d7:

    # MIKA @ lewd "{i}We better find new risky places to do it just to be sure.{/i}"
    MIKA @ lewd "{i}On ferait mieux de trouver de nouveaux endroits risqués pour le faire, juste pour être sûrs.{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:130
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_1811c594:

    # MC @ smile "Is that so?"
    MC @ smile "Ah bon ?"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:131
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_11c7cc1a:

    # MIKA @ blush "I - I should probably get some sleep."
    MIKA @ blush "Je - Je devrais probablement aller dormir."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:132
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_11a68541:

    # MIKA @ blush "M-Maybe visit me sometime?"
    MIKA @ blush "P-Peut-être me rendre visite un jour ?"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:133
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_54dccdca:

    # MC @ smile "Of course, Mika."
    MC @ smile "Bien sûr, Mika."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:134
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_94d11071:

    # "Mika smiled warmly, her eyes filled with...{i}love.{/i}"
    "Mika sourit chaleureusement, ses yeux remplis de...{i}d'amour.{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:135
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_6257b6e4:

    # "Or perhaps just adoration, I wasn't quite sure."
    "Ou peut-être juste de l'adoration, je n'en étais pas tout à fait sûr."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:136
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_aef28641:

    # MIKA @ blush "I- I'll be waiting..."
    MIKA @ blush "Je- Je t'attendrai..."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:137
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_14a4fdae:

    # "Nervously, Mika took a few steps back before heading back to her quarters in a hurry."
    "Nerveusement, Mika fit quelques pas en arrière avant de regagner précipitamment ses quartiers."

# game/data/world_romance/mika/scr_afterCelebration.rpy:139
translate fr rom_mika_after_celebration_event_b5566d24:

    # MC @ smile "(Mika...)"
    MC @ smile "(Mika...)"

